WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:44.240
Meeting Room

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.290
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.830
Who the heck is crying like a baby?!

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.940
Don't make me comfort you.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:50.580
Kei!

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:51.950
My...

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.670
My hair is gone!

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.710
I don't see any signs of thinning,

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.680
though your hair is rather fine.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:02.200
By the way, my hair is on the right.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.290
Ina              Kei
By the way, my hair is on the right.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:04.330
Ina              Kei

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.430
Flimsy
Ina              Kei

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:05.630
Completely Out

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:06.520
No!
Completely Out

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.440
The hair that I've been collecting is gone!
Completely Out

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.980
It was stolen!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.330
There's a thief!

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.690
Exactly why would someone steal hair?

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.030
There's nothing worth
stealing more than hair!

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.670
Ogi, there's trouble!
There's been a thief in the agency!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.450
Don't. I'm sure he's busy.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.510
I'm so sorry...

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.100
I had your hair, too,
and they even stole that.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.920
I couldn't protect it.

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.810
I had kept your bangs and your hair

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.420
from the back of your head in a safe,

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.690
but they stole it all...

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.720
Call Ended

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.930
Hey! He hung up!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.220
What the hell, you jerk?!

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:41.910
Ogi-san has it rough...
That's super annoying.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.340
Your call cannot be completed
due to the customer's request.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:44.730
No kidding. I wonder who stole it.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.850
He blocked me!
No kidding. I wonder who stole it.

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:50.770
Investigating the scene!
Don't underestimate a former police dog!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.870
If only he'd put that much
effort into his actual work...
I'm going to find the
culprit, no matter what!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:53.560
If only he'd put that much
effort into his actual work...

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.570
This is...

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.410
...a hair.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.530
I wonder if it's the thief's hair.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.910
How is it possible for you to ignore

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.160
the hoof prints all over the place?!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.550
This cuticle is not a human's!

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.620
You can tell just by the cuticle?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.860
The cuticles vary depending
on the animal.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.950
My hair is actually like dogs and cats,

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.290
but sadly, I can only love the human cuticle

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:17.780
with its shape like ocean waves.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:18.790
The rise and fall of the waves on
this cuticle is much like my heart...

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.010
Yuuta-kun, stop him!

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.340
This story is gonna run long!

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:22.480
This is...

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.210
a goat hair?!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.850
Don't act like it wasn't obvious!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.920
It's magnificent, it is.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.900
Noah, you are a genius, you are.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.810
I know that.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.220
What's special about these diamonds?

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.710
They're synthetic diamonds
made out of hair.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.530
Diamondon Valentino!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.400
To one-up the wolf, and then
get rich selling these diamonds,

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.070
nothing could be better.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.330
How much hair did you use?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.910
I just need three grams.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.560
They're only worth about 1,000,000 yen,

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.440
but ones made with the hair of
famous people will be worth more.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.800
It'll be great business.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.380
To think that the wolf's
treasure will become my

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.910
money makes me merry, it does.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.860
I think I'll shave off the hair
of everyone in Japa—

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:06.770
Don!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:07.450
Who's there?

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:08.420
Inaba Detective Agency

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.220
This is the wolf's business card!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.790
What is this doing here?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:15.860
I will be by
at midnight
to claim
the cuticle
diamonds.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.650
It is a warning, it is!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.360
The Cuticle Phantom Thief is
after my diamonds, he is!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.880
Arrest him! Arrest him, you will!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:24.610
What?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.370
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.330
Making diamonds out of hair?
You can do that?

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:29.500
Of course.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.600
Don't answer that with hair fetishist logic!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:35.120
Fifty percent of hair is made of kindness.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.050
The other half is carbon!

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:38.710
The same carbon that
diamonds are made of!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.960
Uh, I'm no expert, but I'm sure
there's more to it than that.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.430
Synthetic diamonds made
from hair already exist.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.980
A Spanish company patented it.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.390
The world of hair is amazing!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:52.440
Using people's hair was a dream
of man since the 19th century.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.900
Even I tried making a variety of things
like scarves, rugs, and blankets...

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:00.160
But they're super itchy, so I stopped.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.140
You were right to give up on that.

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:04.570
The history of black hair.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.320
But time has passed,
and now in the 21st century,

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:10.240
the hair is in a completely different field!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.580
Time has caught up with hair!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.460
This technology brought
hair fetishists hope!

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.170
It's not okay for the goat
to use it as he wants!

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:18.980
Do you understand now, Kei?
Tell me that you do!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.880
What's with this wasted passion?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:27.010
If left alone, that goat will go
after all the hair in the world.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.680
I will protect the hair of the world!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.280
Calm down, Inaba-san!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:33.740
Even if it's the goat, if you steal
his diamonds, it's a crime!

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:34.880
Don't stop me, Kei.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.360
I'm going, even if I have to go alone.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.390
I'm coming, too!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.010
Stealing's not good, but going into the
goat's hideout alone is too dangerous.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:46.040
Ogi-san! Inaba-san is going
to battle with the goat

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.320
in order to protect the hair of the world!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.320
What is up with today?

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.060
Is this all of it?

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.210
It is!

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.250
It's sad to think they consider
him a police dog, it is.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.060
What a terrible villain to steal diamonds.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.390
Your body is as hot as ever.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.530
This is the problem with wolves nowadays.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.420
Look who's talking! You're the mafia!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:10.180
Why are you helping the goat, Ogi-san?

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:10.820
Hey, how do you want to die, anyway?

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.050
You're wrong. I'm not helping them.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:13.280
But I can't let Hiroshi become a criminal.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.510
Poison, after all?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.110
Wait, would strangulation just
give you difficulty breathing,

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:16.760
I'm going to stop him at all costs.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:17.480
or will it kill you?

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.670
It's a blackout, it is!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:20.220
Ogi-san!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.060
Hiroshi's here...

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.460
Curse you, wolf!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.370
Whoa, the goat is going crazy!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.590
It's a shame we can't show you!

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.380
You'll be able to see it
on the Blu-ray release.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:28.510
You! Quit with the shameless promotion!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.320
*She's
lying.
Sorry. m(_ _)m

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.750
That was a gunshot!

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.740
Stay close to me, Assistant.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.880
To pick a fight with an
assassin in the dark...

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:37.970
That wolf really is an idiot.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.360
How could you, Gabriella?!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.580
Where are you?! Here?!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:41.790
I won't be discouraged just because I can't see.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.770
How dare you shoot Inaba-san?!

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:45.210
S-Stop...

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.710
You picked the wrong person to mess with.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:49.970
Don!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.330
Curse you, wolf!
How dare you do this to the Don?!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.950
I'll have your head!

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.540
I'll display your head at the prison gates!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.970
Right here! The culprit is right here!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.950
All right, everyone!
We're going to go avenge me!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:00.660
Yeah!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:01.980
The goat is fine!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:07.650
Noah is missing, she is!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.900
Look for her!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.880
Hurry and find Noah, you will!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.870
Crap! They're scattering.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.700
If we don't find Inaba-san before they do,

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:16.910
he'll be in danger!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.090
No need to worry about that.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:18.830
How can you be sure?

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.560
Hiroshi is serious today.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.670
The mafia is in more trouble than he is.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.300
Noah!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.440
He's not here, either...

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.320
Don!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.450
Don's cape is right here,

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.970
meaning he's completely naked!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:03.700
The wolf is holding him
hostage buck naked!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:07.210
Curse you, wolf!
How dare you get him nake—

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:14.930
Noah!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.250
Damn you, wolf.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.350
Where are you?!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:53.800
Don't move!

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.630
Oh, it's just you, Don.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.220
Don't scare me!
I thought you were the wolf.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:06.380
Damn you, wolf! Where'd you go?

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.500
Ogi-san! A goat! A long goat
is slithering this way!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.640
He took my gun...

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.200
Run, minion!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.490
He's... serious...

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:19.490
Faint

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:20.330
She's out of strength.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.760
She's got handcuffs on...
Are they his?

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.060
Nothing less from a masochist.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.750
Never lacking restrictive items.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.910
Is Inaba-san really this
amazing when he's serious?

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.500
He's received combat training
since he was young.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.540
Usually, he's useless,

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.130
but when it comes to hair, it's different.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.800
Ogi-san, are you planning to shoot Inaba-san?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.380
If necessary.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.910
No!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.890
I know I asked you to stop him,

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.730
but you two shouldn't fight!

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:51.480
Lorenzo! He got you, too?!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.690
It is said that bondage starts
with the tortoise shell

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.650
and ends with the tortoise shell...

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.720
But the wolf is extreme...

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.460
What kind of info are you giving us
while you're panting like that?!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.420
Lorenzo!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.870
Curse you, wolf!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:12.380
You are a cruel, heartless,
merciless animal, you are!

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:15.340
This is all because you stole
Inaba-san's hair collection!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.130
You made Inaba-san all serious!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.510
Don't you blame me!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.870
It's his fault for getting
so wound up over just hair!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.390
"Just hair"?

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.290
People from ancient times

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:29.430
believed that as long as
Persephone didn't pluck

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:32.800
a hair from their heads,
they would live forever.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.380
Shall I guide you

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.610
to the queen of Hades, Persephone?

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.830
Don't try so hard to fit in!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:47.380
Looks like you've caused
quite a bit of trouble.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.790
Do you want these diamonds
that badly, Hiroshi?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.290
Smooth diamonds?

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:56.060
You don't get me at all.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.510
The only thing I know about my mother

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.850
is that she was artificially
inseminated with werewolf DNA

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.270
and gave birth to me.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.940
That's all.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.240
So to me, do you realize
how important hair is,

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.530
how important the cuticle is to me?

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.260
The cuticle is a mother's love!

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:16.320
That is my mother's keepsake!
No, her remains!

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:20.400
I can't stand having the cuticle
I loved in the goat's hands!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.060
Such a tragic hair fetishist!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.620
This is tragic,
but he's a hair fetishist!

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.980
What are you going on about?!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.240
Take this!

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.670
He caught the goat!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.040
I am stuck, I am!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.830
Now then... I know you very well.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.920
Unhand me! Unhand me, wolf!
Now then... I know you very well.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:35.680
Unhand me! Unhand me, wolf!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.850
Hand over the diamonds

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:40.800
or the goat's head gets blown off.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:46.010
You won't let a hostage die,
no matter who the criminal is.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.420
Hiroshi...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:52.190
Fine. If you want them that badly...

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:53.400
Go fetch!

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:04.690
Captured.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.190
Aw, damn it!

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:07.300
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.500
Whatever. Just do this forever.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:16.330
I guess I'll let you off the hook since
you caught the Valentino Family.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.430
Yeah, that was amazing, Inaba-san!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.050
You caught them all by yourself!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.400
All of them? What about Noah?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.100
Huh? Didn't you catch her
when you caused the blackout?

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.960
Blackout?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.840
Actually... where is the
goat and the others?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.010
You're a lifesaver.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.810
It's better to avoid the wolf's wrath.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.110
You owe me one!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.730
Untie us already!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.030
Bag-Shaped
Bags
Now
On
Sale
Spring's <b>Springy</b> Manju Buns Fair!!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:47.630
What? Eight? Don't make me laugh.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:51.250
Do you think I can be sated
with so few sacrifices?

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.920
Oh, there's fourteen over here.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:55.370
Not enough.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.880
It's still not enough for my ideal.

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.280
This is...

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.180
Onward...

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.010
...to Inaba Detective Agency.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.260
Walk
Game
Nothing
Nothing!!
Day Off

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.230
Man, I'm bored...

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.030
I wonder if it's okay to be so
bored during the last episode.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.230
It's best when there's no crime going on.

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:31.690
Actually, please don't say
things like "last episode."

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:34.200
So this is the den of the detectives...

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:40.830
Evil Organization Expansion Case

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:41.570
This exaltation...

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.530
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.450
It's been a while since
I felt my blood stir.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.780
Heaven or Hell...

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.600
We shall not know until
I open this door...

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:53.810
Onward!

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:56.840
Corruption attained!

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.810
A very roundabout way of saying "excuse me"!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.480
Gentlemen detectives,

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.190
grant my wish.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.780
Inaba-san, there's a weirdo here!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.760
Those who hide their hair with goats
on their heads should leave.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:07.990
A cool reply?!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.210
I am looking for someone to contract.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:15.050
Help me find a contractor
who suits all of my needs.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:15.950
Contractor?

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.330
On the night of the full moon,

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.210
in exchange for the blood
from my finger as a sign,

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:24.700
I shall offer sixteen sacrifices.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:30.640
I would like them to work hard labor
for one third of a peaceful day.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.430
He's looking for a job that's
eight hours on weekdays

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.250
and pays about 160,000 yen a month.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.910
Wow. You can translate
that, Yuuta-kun?!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.380
That is how they might put
it in the human world.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.980
You're too roundabout with everything!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.790
I see. No. Go home.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:48.820
You're so dependable today, Inaba-san!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.760
I fear that he has already
been here, too...

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:54.790
What kind of world is he living in?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:58.410
Bam

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.510
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:06.820
Y-You fool! Pay me no mind!

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.220
Hurry... Hurry and shut the door!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.980
That's it. That's how it should be.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.120
Employment!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:20.850
Hiroshi, I've got important information
on Valentino. Let's go.
Employment!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:24.520
Hiroshi, I've got important information
on Valentino. Let's go.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.760
What? But it's the last episode.

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.650
I told you, stop saying that!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:29.810
It's this.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.780
Wait, where'd it go?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.570
Did I drop it?

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.570
Are you getting fired for dropping
a key piece of evidence?

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.550
Shut up. It's just a flyer.

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:40.260
You shine so brightly when
Ogi-san messes up, Yuuta-kun.

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.600
Valentino is plotting to
expand his organization.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.230
We have to stop him, no matter what.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.580
But what are we supposed to do?

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:49.510
We know where they're meeting.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.700
An interview hall.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.310
Their method of expanding their
organization is way too proper!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.380
The mafia...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:16:00.240
A befitting end for one who has
fallen into darkness such as I.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.770
Reception

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:07.570
Is it here that I might find a
contractor who fulfills my needs?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.900
You here for an interview?
What's your name?

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.240
You would ask for my accursed name?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.050
I have been dubbed...

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:20.910
Forest Masashi.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.260
Mori Masashi?

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:24.120
Do not speak my proper
name so thoughtlessly!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:24.510
Waiting
Room

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:26.520
Well, wait in the waiting room.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.080
I'll call you when it's your turn.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.130
I extend my gratitude.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.640
Next, interviewee No. 29.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.050
The hell is this name...?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:36.530
Mochi? Is there a Mochi here?

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:39.040
I must assuage this exaltation

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:39.800
I'm Mochi.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:40.000
or my heart will rupture,
engulfing this place in a sea of blood.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.300
It's your turn.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.920
or my heart will rupture,
engulfing this place in a sea of blood.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.080
Thank you.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:43.810
Oh crap!
I'm so nervous
my heart won't
stop pounding!
Translation

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:44.920
Fidget

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:49.260
Is there nothing that can
assist me through this trial?

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:50.530
Fidget

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.950
Please
help
yourself.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:01.700
Is there nothing that can
assist me through this trial?

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.750
Next, Mori. Mori.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:05.650
I know, I'll start drawing symbols
onto my hand with my finger...

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:09.460
Mori! Mori! Mori, Mori!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.280
And swallow...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.380
I've been calling you, Mori Masashi!
Hurry the hell up!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:21.830
Get in, damn it!

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.200
Corruption attained!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.270
Excuse
me.
Translation
Corruption attained!

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.730
Please have a seat.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:28.890
We will now begin the interview, we will.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:32.940
Mori Masashi-san, you don't
seem to have a prior record.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.780
What have you been doing up until now?

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.410
I have been monitoring residential force fields.

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.060
I was home
security.
Translation

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:40.650
Is there a problem?
I was home
security.
Translation

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.420
Is there a problem?

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:44.120
No, we welcome new criminals.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.580
Why did you choose our family?

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.350
With an organization that
has a goat at its head,

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:55.050
I figured my magic could prove useful.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:18:00.010
What position are you seeking, exactly?

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:04.260
We get people like you at times.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:07.500
You think that if you're a goat,
it'll all be fine, don't you?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:07.690
Uh, no...
I didn't mean it
like that, um...
Translation

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:07.970
N-No...

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:10.940
It's quite annoying.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.360
We're not playing around.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:13.690
I would like you to take this seriously.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.540
No... That's not...

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:16.900
Not to mention,

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.140
it's rather absurd that
you'd wear something

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.370
on your head to an important interview.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.040
It's true that the eyes say
what the mouth cannot.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:31.340
We are not asking questions just
to hear the right answer.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:35.130
We need to be able to
see your eyes to see if

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.300
we can trust you as a
member of our family.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:38.730
This goat is wise, but the bag
next to him desecrates his words.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:42.760
Wonderful thinking as always, Don.

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.200
Now, let us continue the interview.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:49.730
Please tell us what is fashionable
about your current outfit.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:55.550
Well, people like you are rather shallow.

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.400
Why exactly should we hire you?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.170
What can you do?

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.210
So begins the pressure interview.

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.080
Can you actually bring
anything to the table?

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:02.100
You're not cut out for the mafia.
So begins the pressure interview.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.620
How unreasonable! Is this really evil?
You're not cut out for the mafia.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:09.870
Not to mention this isn't as cool
of a job as you think it is.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.940
You're wasting our time,
so could you leave?

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.950
You're actually leaving
after being told to leave?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.560
Were you serious about this at all?

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.720
Is that all your resolve is worth?

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:29.310
Feeding off the tears of the weak!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.210
Do you think you can survive
in the world like that?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:31.510
Feeding off the tears of the weak!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:32.420
Has anyone ever needed you?

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:35.020
Is this really what social evil is about?

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.050
This concludes Mori
Masashi-san's interview.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.340
I.... I calmly thank you.

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:42.900
Next person, please.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.250
The human world is a terrifying place.

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:50.210
There is greater evil than me everywhere.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:54.100
I should never have
ventured from the force field.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:57.140
I never shall again...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.480
Pleased to meet you.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.340
Wolf!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.800
How'd you find this place?!

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:08.440
Your company was kind enough
to put out these flyers,

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.320
so we had no problem finding the place.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:12.020
You're replying like it's an interview?!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.280
Inaba Hiroshi, 23 years old.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:18.320
Work experience: Secret Doberman
and Cuticle Detective.

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:25.650
Hobbies: Hair collection.
Skills, of course:

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.120
arresting criminals!

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.500
Run, we must!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.830
Hold it, goat!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.250
Wait!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.790
I will not!

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:38.040
They left. Should we go after them?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.280
Guess we should, even though
I don't really feel like it.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:47.180
Where justice is needed,
evil is sure to prosper.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:47.520
It is a light that can shine only in the dirt.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:48.560
I said hold it!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:49.350
Stop!
It is a light that can shine only in the dirt.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:49.880
It is a light that can shine only in the dirt.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:49.990
And I said I will not wait!
It is a light that can shine only in the dirt.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.890
It is the hope of the weak that
have had their feet muddied.
And I said I will not wait!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:54.280
It is the hope of the weak that
have had their feet muddied.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.450
They're at it again.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.800
Nii-Ni never gets tired of it.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.460
More importantly, Nacchan!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.100
No.

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:01.790
So fast!

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.320
I haven't even said anything yet!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.280
Oh? Mr. Goat?

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:11.200
Wakaba! Azusa! I'll be home tonight!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.480
Papa!

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.180
Is curry okay for dinner?

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:14.800
Yeah!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.460
Papa!

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.400
Hiroshi!

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:20.730
Ack! Ogata.

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:22.930
Looks like you're having fun! Let us join!

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.130
Let us join!

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.430
Ogi, I think since you turned
thirty, you've gotten slower.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.640
You too old now?

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.150
See ya, Thirty!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.530
Thirty!

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.430
Hold it, Ogata!

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:35.900
Let's go, Hiroshi!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:37.920
Yeah!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:42.420
Ack! They've multiplied!
Stop it already, you will!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.590
Like hell we will!

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.560
There is but one way to comfort

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:51.290
him who has cast himself into endless battle.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.570
He must wage war against himself.

00:21:56.810 --> 00:22:00.010
I shall prepare myself
for the next battlefield.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:08.170
The random new character
just closed the show!

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:11.010
End
Cuticle
Detective
Inaba
